# APEX AI-SDLC

- For implementation, debugging, refactoring, security remediation, or review, follow `skills/developer-skill/SKILL.md`.
- For test planning, execution, defect reporting, or fix verification, follow `skills/testing-skill/SKILL.md`.
- Inspect the repository and requirements before choosing specialists or commands.
- Use risk-based specialist selection; do not dispatch every specialist by default.
- Preserve user changes and report only commands and results actually executed.
- Classify test results as `PASSED`, `FAILED`, `BLOCKED`, `SKIPPED`, `NOT_RUN`, `FLAKY`, or `INCONCLUSIVE`.
- Formal UAT and release approval remain with authorized human stakeholders.
